cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived software release."

title: "WP-MORPH: reproducibility package for directional reproducibility of urban morphology relationships across analytical settings"

abstract: >-
  Self-contained reproducibility package for the manuscript
  "Directional reproducibility of urban morphology relationships across analytical settings".
  The package contains frozen analytical inputs, validation-window data, Python code,
  automated tests, manuscript-result mappings and figure-generation scripts that reproduce
  the manuscript-level numerical results and analytical figures. It does not execute or
  authorize the formal CANU production pipeline.

